<li class="toclevel-2 tocsection-10"><a href="#.D0.92.D0.BE.D1.81.D0.BF.D1.80.D0.BE.D0.B8.D0.B7.D0.B2.D0.B5.D0.B4.D1.91.D0.BD.D0.BD.D1.8B.D0.B5_.D0.B4.D0.B8.D0.B0.D0.BB.D0.BE.D0.B3.D0.B8_.D0.BD.D0.B5_.D0.BE.D1.82.D0.BE.D0.B1.D1.80.D0.B0.D0.B6.D0.B0.D1.8E.D1.82.D1.81.D1.8F_.D0.B2_.D0.B6.D1.83.D1.80.D0.BD.D0.B0.D0.BB.D0.B5_.D0.B4.D0.B8.D0.B0.D0.BB.D0.BE.D0.B3.D0.BE.D0.B2_.D0.93.D0.B5.D1.80.D0.BE.D1.8F"><span class="tocnumber">7.1</span> <span class="toctext">Воспроизведённые диалоги не отображаются в журнале диалогов Героя</span></a></li>
